    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...'Technical reasons'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "How unsophisticated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, it gets the job done. They know full well... that we all care greatly about our own reputations. Especially in the face of Victoria's coming future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, they also decided to throw out a bit of bait... Hmph. A flying fortress, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "It pains me to say this, but, as long as they're holding Norport Borough at gunpoint, things are going to get messy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, even Wellington doesn't have the nerve to rush over with his high-speed warship, rain fire down on the old logistics area, and snatch away his new toy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But he won't be able to resist the temptation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Affirmative. The Duke of Wellington's troops have sped up their advance. We suspect he's already gained intel on the airship.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "This massive airship is indeed beyond our calculations, and it has the potential to reshape future wars. But, as the intelligence says, we're far from the point of things spiraling out of control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to our estimates, even if the Sarkaz had a secret channel for transporting supplies, they wouldn't have had the time or resources to build multiple airships.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those damned devils can hardly bring out the value of this technology, but perhaps we can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. Naturally, this is extremely important to me. Even if I don't give the order, I expect that you'll bring it to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, our gaze ought to be cast wider than just this singular piece of technology.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What really worries me is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've let the Sarkaz run amok in the Shard for far too long. Even the most dim-witted fools will eventually figure out what lies behind those buttons and levers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allerdale... I don't blame her. She was never ambitious enough\u2013 that was her strong suit, and I allowed her to keep it. But, it doesn't look like there's any way to make use of our 'Stone of the Sword.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rest assured, the dukes who supported you, along with their vassals, are still resolutely on your side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I promised them peace and safety, and I <i>will</i> deliver.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forever honor one's commitments\u2013 that has always been the motto of House Caster since ancient times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Trilby Asher' is already being dealt with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Naturally. They always have a way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, Your Grace, about the citizens of Norport...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lt. Colonel Lettou said that he was preparing a 'rescue plan.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't go wrong putting your trust in that Gaulish commander. I've met him before\u2013 he's an interesting man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz have never publicly claimed to 'occupy' Londinium, as it has nominally been under the control of the Defense Forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this Lieutenant Colonel has managed to survive in his position for four years without getting caught up in any major trouble either...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We all know how what those devils are like, so that fact alone is respectable enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who knows, maybe he's more keen on becoming a 'savior' than we are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see what you're saying.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Getting the right people into the right positions, and turning valued friends into truly loyal partners... is harder than we initially expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Old Wellington knows what I want, and I know what he wants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though we've never talked about these things openly, we naturally helped each other, all while keeping an extra knife sharpened for one another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Poor thing. Windermere's been playing with the Leithanians for so long, it might be a while until she remembers how Victoria works.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed, we still don't quite understand why the Duke of Windermere is so keenly interested in Norport's affairs. Does she also want that airship technology?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe she wants to add another card to her hand? She knows she's in for a rough time soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "With opportunity comes desire. Both are as honey, equally effective at leading people into the abyss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That cousin of mine failed to understand this, which is why he's been dead for twenty-six years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know, he still appears in my dreams, from time to time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can't say I ever liked him. He was a bombastic, self-righteous boy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "When we were young, he'd run up and down the corridors of the palace, spouting quotes from past kings he saw in some book.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "And, he'd always spew the same trite platitudes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "'A role model for the masses,' 'noblesse oblige,' what have you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "He treated those words as his guiding compass, though they probably didn't even come from the kings they were attributed to. In all likelihood, they were flattering embellishments added by the royal archivists.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "He actually believed those words, and paid the price for it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But despite all that, I sometimes still miss him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "During those years he was still around, we could pretend that all was well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now, even the dullest of men must open their eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Open their eyes, and bear witness to all our ugliness, covetousness, and opportunism\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "War has broken out, and its advent has fulfilled everyone's wishes at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Grace, this is also your chance to unite Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Unity...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria has been trodden upon and sullied for far too long. You have the right to restore her glory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "text": "This war is for Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High-Ranking Officer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, no, my child. This war is not for Victoria alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Victoria.' How we love to speak the name of our country\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. It's nothing more than a rag to cover festering abscesses when the people are in need of morality, an empty husk to exploit hope when the people are in need of dignity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "All those farmers, laborers, soldiers, and nobles... All these who despise each other, who grope at each others' throats. Why does lumping all of them together make the great Victoria?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "When they speak of Victoria, what is it they refer to? The fields they've tilled for half a lifetime? The factories that've gorged on their blood and tears?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Collections of looted artifacts? Great halls of imported carpets? A splotch of color with a line of text on an atlas? Or, a news headline and a set of economic figures on a television set?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or, is it the vast, glorious, and invincible empire built upon the foundations of each man's imagination?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_726_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let us prepare ourselves. Let us wait with bated breath.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take a good look. Witness where this war will take us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Duke of Caster"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
