    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good day, sir\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lemme guess. You wanna be strung up on that fence too, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, I don't have a lot of fun with that job. I suggest you turn around and crawl back to where you belong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, please wait, good sir! I just... The others just wanted me to come talk to you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "Err, that's not what I meant... We just have a few trivial issues, so if you could show us a bit of mercy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "When did you Victorians start taking us devils for a bunch of bleeding hearts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we wanted... was to know what's going on in Norport Borough...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing worth mentioning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What if... Look, we can still scrounge up some valuable trinkets. Surely, you've heard of Sargon's gems...? I have a number of them here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I get it, you're not interested, huh? I also have a collection of old Gaulish paintings that are said to be priceless\u2013 Oh, alright! M-Maybe I was out of line to say that. This is going to cost me my life, isn't it...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about a Sankta patron firearm? I just happen to have one stashed away back home...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Interesting... You got your hands on an angel's guardian gun huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_177",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, um, it's not mine though! It's just for safekeeping... Heavens, those angels from the Notarial Hall are going to flay me alive if they find out, but if you're interested\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just happened to hear, you\u2013 Err, the Sarkaz enjoy collecting them, so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Timid Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up. I prefer my angelic toys freshly looted from a pile of corpses. Now, piss off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz! We just want to know what's going on! This is a perfectly legitimate request!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Citizen"
    },
    {
        "text": "So many of us have been driven out of our homes and crammed into a little ghetto with no place to live, no food, and no freedom. Now, all we want is an explanation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are all these houses not good enough for you? Pick a door, any door\u2013 knock on one of them, and get your sorry ass inside. What more do you want? A bathtub with a built-in back massager?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't treat us like this! Where are the Defense Forces? I personally know Lettou and want to speak with him! We haven't broken any rules!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_242",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
