        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a waste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen up, you sorry worms. To tell the truth, I'd like nothing more than to slaughter each and every one of you right now. Seeing your faces makes me sick. But the boss says you lot are still useful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I promised him\u2013 I'd show a little restraint.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the grace I've afforded you, but know that I can take it back just as easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_864_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry! Run! Get away from here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Feline Woman"
    },
