        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Run, run, as fast you can, pathetic Victorians! You've had your fun already! Now, it's your time to get a taste of the life once forced onto us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hide in every nook and cranny, hide beneath every shadow. Rip up your morality and swallow your dignity! This is everything we Sarkaz have experienced! Now, rejoice, because it's yours too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call it equality. This is the kind of equality you've never known!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Explain myself? Answer your questions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, this is war, you dipshits!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Learn it! Embrace it! Just like we did for thousands of years!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Soldier"
    },
